001525878906,"flMinProgress":0,"flCurrentProgress":0,"flMaxProgress":10},{"strID":"Achievement004","strName":"强拆","strDescription":"完成“拆除”","strImage":"https://shared.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/477160/5167774a19971b9bd12243b152b6c9127fdf88e5.jpg","bAchieved":false,"rtUnlocked":0,"flAchieved":52.099998474121094,"flMinProgress":0,"flCurrentProgress":0,"flMaxProgress":0}],"vecAchievedHidden":[],"nTotal":147,"nAchieved":0}}],["workshop_trendy_items",{"version":2}],["associations",{"version":2,"data":{"rgDevelopers":[{"strName":"No Brakes Games","strURL":null}],"rgPublishers":[{"strName":"Curve Games","strURL":"https://store.steampowered.com/publisher/curvedigital"}],"rgFranchises":[{"strName":"Curve Games","strURL":"https://store.steampowered.com/franchise/curvedigital"}]}}],["descriptions",{"version":1,"data":{"strFullDescription":"[p][img width=\"616\" height=\"50\"]https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/477160/extras/3d4ceb9d6add0b7e3115dbcb05d9a9af.webp?t=1766076111[/img][/p][h2][b]***新关卡“蒸汽朋克派对”现已发布***[/b][/h2][p][b]《猛兽派对》瓦特和尼莫现已在《人类一败涂地》中登场[/b] [/p][p]《猛兽派对》里的明星角色瓦特和尼莫来啦！他们已经准备好加入《人类一败涂地》的疯狂世界，开启一段新的冒险！瓦特和尼莫将在第31个官方关卡“蒸汽朋克派对”中惊喜亮相。危险的蒸汽喷口、破裂的管道，以及令人头晕的高空平台，他们能完成这个新的挑战吗？[/p][p][b]加入全球超过5500万玩家的大家庭，一起探索社区创作者打造的 5000 多个关卡吧！[/b] [/p][p] [/p][h2][b]《人类一败涂地》是一款轻松搞笑的沙雕游戏，游戏的场景发生在飘渺的梦境之中。[/b][/h2][p][imgvid poster.avif=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/477160/extras/388713dc57650f208529b64ca6e01337.poster.avif?t=1766076111\" webm=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/477160/extras/388713dc57650f208529b64ca6e01337.webm?t=1766076111\" width=\"640\" height=\"320\"][/imgvid][/p][p]每个梦境关卡会提供一个全新的环境让玩家探索，从豪宅、城堡和阿兹台克到雪山、光怪陆离的夜景和工业区。每关都贯穿有多条路线和完美设置的谜题，确保热衷探索和聪明的玩家能得到奖励。 [/p][p][img width=\"616\" height=\"50\"]https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/477160/extras/627cd0aa152d3eed906c49015acd3fb1.webp?t=1766076111[/img][/p][p][imgvid poster.avif=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/477160/extras/445e027a309d222ed059ffd20926d6e9.poster.avif?t=1766076111\" webm=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/477160/extras/445e027a309d222ed059ffd20926d6e9.webm?t=1766076111\" width=\"640\" height=\"208\"][/imgvid][/p][p]需要帮忙把巨石装上投石器，或者需要有人来打破那堵墙？最多8名玩家的在线多人模式会改变《人类一败涂地》的游戏方式。\r\n[/p][p]\r\n[img width=\"616\" height=\"50\"]https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/477160/extras/0c0e5db45bbad505f4a719cea1a08b77.webp?t=1766076111[/img][/p][p][imgvid poster.avif=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/477160/extras/7f680201dd84757d405a8ade5b6adb5e.poster.avif?t=1766076111\" webm=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/477160/extras/7f680201dd84757d405a8ade5b6adb5e.webm?t=1766076111\" width=\"640\" height=\"208\"][/imgvid][/p][p]你的软趴趴小人由你自己来定制。可以选择建筑工人、大厨、跳伞员、矿工、宇航员或忍者的服装。还可以分别打扮你的脑袋、上半身和下半身，并且用脑洞让一切变得创意十足！ \r\n[/p][p][img width=\"616\" height=\"50\"]https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/477160/extras/40418a9a16c62e44bfc204cbdd3bc039.webp?t=1766076111[/img][/p][p][imgvid poster.avif=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/477160/extras/0ecdd7c2fa45fb187d2f6d51594d3045.poster.avif?t=1766076111\" webm=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/477160/extras/0ecdd7c2fa45fb187d2f6d51594d3045.webm?t=1766076111\" width=\"600\" height=\"200\"][/imgvid][/p][p]仅在Steam平台上发布的《人类一败涂地》创意工坊，是一个绝佳的工具，与Unity一起使用，可以让玩家打造自己的《人类一败涂地》内容，并和全世界的玩家分享。对自己打造关卡、大厅或皮肤不感兴趣？你还可以在Steam上直接下载和探索超过5000个别人的创意关卡！ [/p][p][/p][p][img width=\"616\" height=\"50\"]https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/477160/extras/09af9737c76e676c1d919b6442f40334.webp?t=1766076111[/img][/p][p][b]生机勃勃的玩家社群[/b] \r\n[/p][p][imgvid poster.avif=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/477160/extras/72f28d1421041bd61cec9710dedaf37c.poster.avif?t=1766076111\" webm=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/477160/extras/72f28d1421041bd61cec9710dedaf37c.webm?t=1766076111\" width=\"600\" height=\"200\"][/imgvid][/p][p]主播和UP主们对《人类一败涂地》尤为青睐，就因为其独特搞笑的游戏方式。这些视频的综合播放量已多达6亿！[/p]","strSnippet":"《人类一败涂地》是一款轻松搞笑的沙雕游戏，游戏的场景发生在飘渺的梦境之中。玩家既可以单机自闭，也可以最多八人联机一起欢畅。游戏支持的创意工坊，还可以让大家免费玩到不计其数的高质量玩家关卡和皮肤。游戏支持中文。"}}]]